{"parse": {"title": "序章-01", "pageid": 55554, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">序章-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BA%8F%E7%AB%A0-02\" title=\"序章-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">序章</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.91.87.E6.BB.9A.E7.94.B5.E5.8F.B0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"摇滚电台\">摇滚电台</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 摇滚电台</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Rock'in Radio</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0deck.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0deck\"><img alt=\"0deck\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-0deck.png/600px-Cg-0deck.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-0deck.png/900px-Cg-0deck.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-0deck.png/1200px-Cg-0deck.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">是雨声。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">不，</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">不对。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">是“暴雨”。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">“暴雨”要来了。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">怎么，感到有些晕船？</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">睁开你们的双眼，跟屁虫们！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">现在是正午12点，APPLe号“摇滚巨轮”迎来了最不受欢迎的乘客——</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">本海盗将对你们这几天的跟踪罪行——</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">进行正式的公开审讯！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">准备好被接下来的摇滚乐颠覆得日夜不分吧！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">现在，收音机前的同胞们，跟我一起，疯狂倒数——！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">三！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">二！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">一！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">说出你们的名字，英国政府的跟屁虫！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">说出你们的名字，重塑之手的抢劫犯！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">封杀音乐？</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">洗劫商船？</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">我们由此紧闭双唇，我们从此公海流浪——</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">但又有谁能改变，</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">人们对自由永远的憧憬——！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>怎么了？！发生了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我们身后多了一只漆黑的大船。它正在向我们炮击！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我的天啊——快关掉麦克风！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_chongsupaoqian1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_chongsupaoqian1\"><img alt=\"at_chongsupaoqian1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-at_chongsupaoqian1.png/600px-Cg-at_chongsupaoqian1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-at_chongsupaoqian1.png/900px-Cg-at_chongsupaoqian1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-at_chongsupaoqian1.png/1200px-Cg-at_chongsupaoqian1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>舰桥……有血管的炮管……这是什么怪物？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>开什么玩笑！我只是放了首歌而已？！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_chongsupaoqian2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_chongsupaoqian2\"><img alt=\"at_chongsupaoqian2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-at_chongsupaoqian2.png/600px-Cg-at_chongsupaoqian2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-at_chongsupaoqian2.png/900px-Cg-at_chongsupaoqian2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-at_chongsupaoqian2.png/1200px-Cg-at_chongsupaoqian2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长，那是重塑之手的标志！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尖锐的风声传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>重塑之手？那群恐怖主义暴徒？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>难道是因为我的<b>“小东西”</b>？……还是因为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我明白了……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0deck.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0deck\"><img alt=\"0deck\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-0deck.png/600px-Cg-0deck.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-0deck.png/900px-Cg-0deck.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-0deck.png/1200px-Cg-0deck.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>是你们的同伙来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>别忘了，你们现在还是本海盗的俘虏！让他们立刻停止攻击，否则——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又一枚炮弹击中了船帆。硝烟和火星的气味瞬间弥漫开来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>咳、咳咳……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我们正在下沉。请做好弃船的准备，我的船长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>呜哇……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她手忙脚乱地解开俘虏身上的禁言术法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>喂、喂喂——！我可以把你们交出去啦……但请不要打坏我的船！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>这些唱片很珍贵的……你们不要太暴力了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>听到了就快说句话，嘿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员Ⅱ：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-500101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-500101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-500101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员Ⅰ：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员Ⅰ：</div><div>咳咳、咳咳……我们不认识他们。我们很早就想说了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员Ⅱ：</div><div>我们是基金会的调查员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员Ⅰ：</div><div>你抓错人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>保护唱片——！！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "序章-01"}}